  "usage_note": "Scissors is plural only and takes a plural verb: the scissors are in the drawer. To count them, or when you need a singular, say a pair of scissors, two pairs of scissors; a pair of scissors takes a singular verb: this pair is blunt. Scissor without s appears only before another noun, as in scissor kick.",
